    "chunk_text": "ite & wyrmas onweg to donne \u00f0e on cildum beo\u00f0 b\u00e6rn hundes \u00f0ost & gnid smale, mengc wi\u00f0 Seo self ade\u00fe \u00f0a wyrmas onweg. Nim eac \u00fe\u00e6t gr\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r hund gedrite\u00fe, cnuca, wri\u00f0 on. Hra\u00f0e hyt h\u00e6l\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 w\u00e6teradle, nim drigne hundes \u00feost, wyrc to drence. He h\u00e6le\u00f0 w\u00e6terseoce. Dweorg onweg to donne, hwites hundes \u00feost gecnucadne to duste & gemengen wi\u00f0 meolowe & to & \u00e6fter \u00feam he lytla\u00f0 & onweg gewite\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 w\u00e6teradle, hundes spiw\u00fean lege & wri\u00f0 on \u00feam inno\u00f0e, \u00feurh \u00feone utgang seo w\u00e6teradl ut \u00d0a \u00fee scinlac \u00ferowien etan leon fl\u00e6sc. Ne \u00ferowia\u00f0 hy ofer \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig scinlac. Wi\u00f0 earena sare, nim leon gelynde, mylt on scylle, drype on \u00fe\u00e6t eare. Sona him by\u00fe sel. Wi\u00f0 \u00e6lcum sare, gemylted leon gelynde & \u00fe\u00e6rmid gesmyred. \u00c6lc sar hyt geli\u00f0iga\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 sina & wi\u00f0 cneowa leo\u00f0a sarum, nim leon gelynde & heortes mearg, mylt & gemeng tosomne, Sona hyt by\u00fe hal. Wi\u00f0 n\u00e6ddrena eardunge & aflygennysse fearres horn geb\u00e6rnedne to acsan stred \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6dran eardien. Hy fleo\u00f0 onweg. Wommas of andwlatan to donne, smyre mid fearres blode. Ealle \u00fea wommas hyt of genime\u00fe. Fearres geallan, wi\u00f0 eagena \u00feystru & genipe",
